        <mxCell id="49" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#1E293B;strokeColor=#0F172A;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;shadow=0;" value="8. EXPLAINABLE AI (XAI) SUITE" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="570" x="1210" y="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="50" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(30, 41, 59);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;5-Tier Interpretability Framework:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;SHAP Beeswarm: Identifies CCCT and resistance as the most influential features, contributing over 68% of total feature importance.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;LIME Lifespan Progression: Shows that charge time mainly affects early battery aging, while resistance becomes more influential in later stages.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;PDP / ICE Curves: Visualize how battery degradation accelerates sharply around the 100th cycle (knee point).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;ARD Relevance (&lt;span&gt;\(1/\ell_j\)&lt;/span&gt;): Identifies latent dimensions &lt;span&gt;\(z_1\)&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span&gt;\(z_3\)&lt;/span&gt; as the main contributors to model uncertainty.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Analytical Sensitivities: Measures how changes in each input affect predictions, confirming non-zero contributions from Cycle (0.0250), CCCT (0.0245), CVCT (0.0189), and Resistance (0.0166).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="374" width="541" x="1224.5" y="566" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="51" parent="1" style="shape=image;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/jpeg;base64,;" value="" vertex="1">
