        <mxCell id="58" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1.45; color: rgb(30, 41, 59);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;1. &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Extreme Accuracy:&lt;/b&gt; Outperforms all 13 baselines (&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;RMSE = 0.0371&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;R&lt;sup&gt;2&lt;/sup&gt; = 0.986&lt;/b&gt;) on dynamic Artemis cycles.&lt;br&gt;2. &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Safety Verification:&lt;/b&gt; 100% empirical coverage under calibrated 95% Bayesian intervals.&lt;br&gt;3. &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Auditable Transparency:&lt;/b&gt; Evolved closed-form equation inspectable with standard calculus.&lt;br&gt;4. &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Ultra-Low Power Edge:&lt;/b&gt; Deploys at &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;0.158 ms&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1.89 mJ&lt;/b&gt; per inference on Jetson Orin Nano.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
